<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics (Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo))",
        "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics faithfully reproduces Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 58.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-drosophila-ventral-furrow-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py> ;
    schema:about "Drosophila melanogaster (gastrulating cellular blastoderm embryo)" ;
