<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Conte et al. (2012), Martin et al. (2009) & He et al. (2014) Drosophila ventral furrow invagination biomechanics — MorphoEval overall 58.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py` (59.0/100). The initial script verifies incompressible trapezoidal cell area conservation and compares basic wild-type vs apical-only invagination, but requires explicit integration of the Martin et al. (2009) ratcheted Myosin-II pulse ODE `dL_ap/dt = -alpha_pulse*M(t) + beta_relax*(1 - r_twist)*(L_0 - L_ap)`, all 6 Conte et al. (2012) biomechanical/mutant regimes (wild-type full synergy, apical+basal relaxation, apical-only, concertina mutant, unratcheted recoil, and twist;snail double-null control), 2D polygonal blastoderm cross-section ring reconstruction, and automated 4-stage confocal segmentation on `drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg`. Overall 58.2/100 (faithfulness 56.4, reproducibility 62.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 62, Morphological realism / specimen match 52, Parameter expressivity 57, Morphometric validation 56, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 61. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_ventral_furrow_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 112787 B, 1495×624 px, artifact_sha256 877d89b820fd2debb25ddbc99e3f627bbe99a15a7327f54c18c26df702ed6ae5 (sha256 877d89b820fd2debb25ddbc99e3f627bbe99a15a7327f54c18c26df702ed6ae5), spec_fingerprint 472aac8153c8fe9cc40194b17fd78b655588c12f710d6e8a68aba7963971c58f. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 472aac8153c8fe9cc40194b17fd78b655588c12f710d6e8a68aba7963971c58f; artifact_sha256: 877d89b820fd2debb25ddbc99e3f627bbe99a15a7327f54c18c26df702ed6ae5; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/drosophila_ventral_furrow_reference.json=5c6f1960cef1be19..., datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg=f426366f7ede436d..., datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/scout_manifest.json=0c6354ab1d934ba3...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add automated 4-stage confocal cross-section segmentation and apical Myosin-II red enrichment analysis on `datasets/drosophila_ventral_furrow/drosophila_ventral_furrow_specimen.jpg`.",
        "remediation needed: Evaluate all 6 Conte et al. (2012) & Martin et al. (2009) biomechanical/mutant regimes (`wildtype_synergistic_invagination`, `apical_plus_basal_relaxation`, `apical_constriction_only`, `concertina_uncoordinated_mutant`, `unratcheted_twist_recoil_mutant`, `snail_twist_double_null_control`) and a 15x15 2D parameter morphospace.",
        "remediation needed: Implement explicit RK2 integration of the Martin et al. (2009) ratcheted Myosin-II pulse ODE `dL_ap/dt = -alpha_pulse*M(t) + beta_relax*(1 - r_twist)*(L_0 - L_ap)` and reconstruct the 64-cell 2D incompressible blastoderm ring." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.82e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-he-drosophila-ventral-furrow-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
